inks at you while you work, after all. Just don't think too much about what the medics would say at your next checkup.","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":3000,"atk":350,"def":240,"res":35,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":4}},"weakening_node":{"slug":"weakening_node","name":"Weakening Node","icon":null,"rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":null,"abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":100,"def":500,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1}},"static_oneiros_enemy_10080_mpiced":{"slug":"static_oneiros_enemy_10080_mpiced","name":"Static Oneiros α","icon":"/enemies-icons/Static Oneiros α.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Originium Creation","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Originating from an archived enemy. It seems unremarkable, but is able to strike before our operators take action. The mechanism by which it does so is unknown.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Shortly after it enters the battle, throws a bomb to temporarily disable the Operator with the highest DP cost in your Deployment Waiting Zone"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":3500,"atk":500,"def":360,"res":40,"elementalRes":10,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"mockup_auto_meal_distributor":{"slug":"mockup_auto_meal_distributor","name":"Mockup Auto Meal Distributor","icon":"/enemies-icons/Mockup Auto Meal Distributor.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Originium Creation","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Cafeteria meal distributor that is still in beta testing. A busy operator had the bright idea to attach a maintenance helper to it—to save the effort of walk